[
  {
    "text": "Alaska has spent decades mapping",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 2.5500000000000003,
    "seg": 0
  },
  {
    "text": "the days you must not burn.",
    "start": 2.58,
    "end": 4.4,
    "seg": 0
  },
  {
    "text": "Nobody has mapped the days you",
    "start": 5.0,
    "end": 7.109999999999999,
    "seg": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "can.",
    "start": 7.14,
    "end": 7.84,
    "seg": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "On July thirty first, the National",
    "start": 8.12,
    "end": 10.450000000000001,
    "seg": 2
  },
  {
    "text": "Science Foundation paid the University",
    "start": 10.48,
    "end": 12.99,
    "seg": 2
  },
  {
    "text": "of Alaska Fairbanks one point six",
    "start": 13.02,
    "end": 15.450000000000001,
    "seg": 2
  },
  {
    "text": "million dollars to find them.",
    "start": 15.48,
    "end": 17.12,
    "seg": 2
  },
  {
    "text": "A prescribed burn is a fire",
    "start": 17.8,
    "end": 19.75,
    "seg": 3
  },
  {
    "text": "you set on purpose, so a",
    "start": 19.78,
    "end": 21.65,
    "seg": 3
  },
  {
    "text": "wildfire has less to eat.",
    "start": 21.68,
    "end": 23.28,
    "seg": 3
  },
  {
    "text": "It works, and Alaska barely uses",
    "start": 23.92,
    "end": 26.189999999999998,
    "seg": 4
  },
  {
    "text": "it.",
    "start": 26.22,
    "end": 26.919999999999998,
    "seg": 4
  },
  {
    "text": "N S F says Alaska lacks",
    "start": 27.16,
    "end": 29.25,
    "seg": 5
  },
  {
    "text": "the forecasting tools.",
    "start": 29.28,
    "end": 30.6,
    "seg": 5
  },
  {
    "text": "So the Fairbanks team is reading",
    "start": 31.12,
    "end": 33.03,
    "seg": 6
  },
  {
    "text": "decades of weather with machine",
    "start": 33.06,
    "end": 34.87,
    "seg": 6
  },
  {
    "text": "learning, hunting for the days",
    "start": 34.9,
    "end": 36.769999999999996,
    "seg": 6
  },
  {
    "text": "that were safe.",
    "start": 36.8,
    "end": 37.5,
    "seg": 6
  },
  {
    "text": "That isn't a forecast.",
    "start": 38.12,
    "end": 39.12,
    "seg": 7
  },
  {
    "text": "It's a count of safe days.",
    "start": 39.76,
    "end": 41.36,
    "seg": 7
  },
  {
    "text": "And a count is something you",
    "start": 41.92,
    "end": 43.33,
    "seg": 8
  },
  {
    "text": "can hand to people who don't",
    "start": 43.36,
    "end": 44.91,
    "seg": 8
  },
  {
    "text": "agree.",
    "start": 44.94,
    "end": 45.64,
    "seg": 8
  },
  {
    "text": "Because land around one village",
    "start": 45.7,
    "end": 47.61,
    "seg": 9
  },
  {
    "text": "can answer to four governments",
    "start": 47.64,
    "end": 49.47,
    "seg": 9
  },
  {
    "text": "at once.",
    "start": 49.5,
    "end": 50.2,
    "seg": 9
  },
  {
    "text": "Four parties who've never had the",
    "start": 50.74,
    "end": 52.87,
    "seg": 10
  },
  {
    "text": "same sheet of paper.",
    "start": 52.9,
    "end": 53.97,
    "seg": 10
  },
  {
    "text": "So the grant pays to get",
    "start": 54.0,
    "end": 56.17,
    "seg": 11
  },
  {
    "text": "those four talking.",
    "start": 56.2,
    "end": 57.36,
    "seg": 11
  },
  {
    "text": "But it isn't finished.",
    "start": 58.02,
    "end": 59.0,
    "seg": 12
  },
  {
    "text": "None of this reaches a fire",
    "start": 59.62,
    "end": 61.15,
    "seg": 12
  },
  {
    "text": "crew until twenty thirty.",
    "start": 61.18,
    "end": 62.66,
    "seg": 12
  },
  {
    "text": "And who pays when a burn",
    "start": 63.14,
    "end": 64.69,
    "seg": 13
  },
  {
    "text": "escapes isn't in this award.",
    "start": 64.72,
    "end": 66.7,
    "seg": 13
  },
  {
    "text": "But nothing moves without that",
    "start": 67.34,
    "end": 69.13,
    "seg": 14
  },
  {
    "text": "count.",
    "start": 69.16,
    "end": 69.86,
    "seg": 14
  },
  {
    "text": "You can't staff a crew for",
    "start": 70.06,
    "end": 71.53,
    "seg": 14
  },
  {
    "text": "a day nobody calls safe.",
    "start": 71.56,
    "end": 73.18,
    "seg": 14
  },
  {
    "text": "Alaska knows exactly which days",
    "start": 73.88,
    "end": 76.15,
    "seg": 15
  },
  {
    "text": "it's in danger.",
    "start": 76.18,
    "end": 77.0,
    "seg": 15
  },
  {
    "text": "Somebody is finally paid to count",
    "start": 77.68,
    "end": 79.87,
    "seg": 16
  },
  {
    "text": "the days it's allowed.",
    "start": 79.9,
    "end": 81.16,
    "seg": 16
  }
]